OL,3,GNEWSASix arrests after gunshots fired
OL,4,Ain Willenhall
OL,5,
OL,6,FGunshots have been fired in a Black
OL,7,FCountry street after a disorder broke
OL,8,Fout.
OL,10,FEmergency services received a flurry of
OL,11,F999 calls following the disturbance on
OL,12,FTemple Road, Willenhall, at around
OL,13,F17:45 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FWhile one person was hurt, no one is
OL,16,Fbelieved to have suffered gunshot
OL,17,Finjuries, West Midlands Police said.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
