OL,3,GNEWSASix arrests after gunshots fired
OL,4,Ain Willenhall
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have been arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with the incident. The area
OL,8,Fwas cordoned off and police remained at
OL,9,Fthe scene on Saturday, while
OL,10,Finvestigations continue.
